## Description

Jensen Huang says Nvidia could only have happened in America. The reason is the hardest thing on earth for a country to build.  Huang: “Nvidia genuinely is an only in America story. It’s a chain of extremely low probability events that leads to Nvidia.”  A chain that long https://t.co/W7H0U58Wx6

